   "boundElements": [],
   "text": "A preference in this kit may be STRICTER than an enforced\ncontrol. It may never be looser.\n\nWhen the two disagree, the move is neither to override nor to\nroute around: stop at the control, name what stopped it, and\nsay what has to be decided.",
   "fontSize": 13,
